sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interaction
    participant Intent Router
    participant Workflow
    participant TDD
    participant Enforcement
    participant Master
    
    User->>Interaction: Request
    Interaction->>Intent Router: Classify Intent
    Intent Router->>Workflow: Route to Workflow
    Workflow->>TDD: Execute TDD
    TDD->>Enforcement: Validate Rules
    Enforcement->>Master: Coordinate
    Master->>User: Response
